title: Storefront + email/password auth — assessment & scope
summary: 'Assessed repo state before starting Matt''s assigned work: a public storefront with product display, and email+password account creation (basic, tech-demo grade). Backend has wallet-checkout scaffold (Circle DCW, spend caps, orders/products tables) but NO frontend and NO real auth (checkout uses a Bearer=userId hackathon stand-in). World ID selfie validation is a later phase, deferred.'
